  "details": "[1093] I notice that this only happens when I join a world off of a friend that has their status set to 'Join Me' although it does not occur every time. I want to stress that this is a glitch, and I am not actually blocked by anyone in the room.\nWhat occurs: I will join a room and most people cannot see or hear me, although I can see and hear everyone. I do not appear on their social menus as in the room. Usually there is at least one person that can see/hear me, and it is never the person I join off of. Rooms have no less than 5 people at the time the glitch occurs.\nFrequency: I've seen/experienced this at least once a week in the last 4 weeks. I've experienced it 3 times, and seen it once (that I'm aware of).\nAttempted Solutions: how many times it worked/how many situations it was attempted\n- \"Blocked\" person respawns: 1/2\n- Everyone else respawns: 0/1\n- \"Blocked\" person restarts VRC: 1/1\n- Everyone else blocks>unblocks the \"blocked\" person: 2/2",
